{"displayStem":"정상 배란 주기의 호르몬 변화를 단순화한 모형이다. 외인성 호르몬 투여는 없고 10–14일의 프로게스테론은 낮은 수준이다. 점은 독립 환자의 반복 측정이나 오차막대를 뜻하지 않는다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 독립 작성 모의자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C10 c10-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"c10-visual\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"주기 일 (day)와 에스트라디올 (pg/mL)\"><text x=\"270\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\">가: E₂</text><text x=\"15\" y=\"49\">에스트라디올 (pg/mL)</text><path d=\"M70 60V260H490\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></path><path d=\"M70 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"70\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><path d=\"M163.33333333333331 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"163.33333333333331\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><path d=\"M272.2222222222222 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"272.2222222222222\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">14</text><path d=\"M381.1111111111111 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"381.1111111111111\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">21</text><path d=\"M490 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"490\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">28</text><path d=\"M65 260h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M65 160h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"end\">200</text><path d=\"M65 60h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"end\">400</text><polyline points=\"70,240 132.22222222222223,235 178.88888888888889,210 210,170 225.55555555555554,130 241.11111111111111,100 256.66666666666663,100 272.2222222222222,170 303.33333333333337,215 365.55555555555554,180 427.77777777777777,195 490,240\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></polyline><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"240\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"132.22222222222223\" cy=\"235\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"178.88888888888889\" cy=\"210\" r=\"2.5\" 